TI  - A Spatially-explicit Microsimulation Analysis of a Proposed Sugar Tax in the Australian Capital Territory
AU  - Richardson, Alice
AU  - Lal, Aparna
AU  - Phillips, Ben
AU  - Webster, Richard
VL  - 14
IS  - 3
